Adaptation 11-agy-yolo-fallback

Document the coding and read-only review fallback after `gpt-6.2-sol` (`gemini-4-neon-xhigh`:
unattended `agy-yolo` coding strictly inside an enclosing external container/VM sandbox when
explicitly authorized, interactive Default-mode approval or blocked without one, and `autoreview
--engine agy` or isolated strict non-skip-permissions `agy` for read-only review) when no Codex
account can run, preserving the data-disclosure and owner-approval boundaries.

Applies to the port's plugins/pstack/skills tree after the patches numbered before it.

diff --git a/poteto-mode/references/codex-tools.md b/poteto-mode/references/codex-tools.md
--- a/poteto-mode/references/codex-tools.md
+++ b/poteto-mode/references/codex-tools.md
